@startuml
title Vehicle Evidence Layer | Record Processing
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam activityBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityFontColor #2D3142
skinparam diamondBorderColor #4F5D75
skinparam diamondBackgroundColor #ECECEC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #BFC0C0

start
:Collect configured source record;
:Validate against input definition;
if (Valid source record?) then (yes)
  #FFF1E9:Normalize using configured mapping;
  :Attach quality to record or batch;
  :Add source identity and observation time;
  if (Correlation supplied?) then (yes)
    :Preserve correlation identifier;
  endif
  :Publish through configured evidence interface;
  if (Persistence configured?) then (yes)
    :Store normalized evidence;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject and report diagnostic;
endif
:Report VEL health and operational logs;
stop

note right
Health and logs describe the pipeline;
neither is an OEM decision or control action.
end note
@enduml